<title>FRANCE: CEP remains suspended on Friday.</title>
<headline>CEP remains suspended on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of French specialist publisher CEP Communication will remain suspended today following a buy-out bid by 74-percent owner Havas on Thursday, the SBF French Bourses' Association said.</p>
<p>&quot;CEP remains suspended today. We will make a statement about when it will resume but it is not certain the statement will be made today,&quot; an SBF spokeswoman said.</p>
</text>
